  "body": "Sun, Space & Style\r\n\r\nWelcome to Lot 1 / 50 Alexander Avenue, Torbay – widely regarded as the premium position in the development. This brand-new end residence delivers exceptional natural light, thoughtful design, and a level of outdoor living rarely found in townhouse living.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• End unit with three-sided light exposure – bright all day\r\n• 3 spacious bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms\r\n• Master suite with ensuite\r\n• Open-plan living, dining & kitchen flowing seamlessly to a sunny timber deck\r\n• Internal access garage plus additional street parking\r\n• Front lawn + rear deck – a rare and practical combination\r\n\r\nDesign & Build Quality\r\n\r\nA striking exterior with teal roofing, mixed cladding, and black joinery, paired with warm, modern interiors:\r\n• Timber-grain designer kitchen\r\n• Stone / marble-look bathrooms\r\n• Quality finishes throughout\r\n\r\nBuilt with both style and long-term durability in mind.\r\n\r\nLocation & Lifestyle\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned for convenience and coastal living:\r\n• Zoned for Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate, Long Bay College\r\n• Easy walk to Torbay Beach and Long Bay Regional Park\r\n• Minutes to local shops, Countdown, cafés & amenities\r\n\r\nPerfect For\r\n• First home buyers wanting quality + lifestyle\r\n• Families prioritising top school zones\r\n• Downsizers seeking low maintenance without compromise\r\n• Investors looking for high-demand rental location\r\n\r\nWhy This One Stands Out\r\n\r\nNot all townhouses are created equal – this end position + real outdoor space + superior natural light combination is extremely limited and highly sought after.\r\n\r\nWhere beach meets convenience, and design meets function.\r\n\r\nContact us today to secure this standout home.",
